::  c6: standard (kernel) build whose entry is outside the dependency root:
::  the directory-hash key for the entry falls back to its canonical path
::  (honk.rs entry_path_for_hoon ~4714-4737; build_entry_wer ~873-879)
/=  raw  /common/raw-thing
/*  blob  %jam  /data/blob/jam
|=  hash=@uvI
^-  *
[hash raw blob]
